<title>UK: Royal Sun announces buyback with 1st results.</title>
<headline>Royal Sun announces buyback with 1st results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Insurance Group Plc said on Thursday it would seek shareholders agreement to buy back up to five percent of share capital as it reported its first annual results since its creation in a six billion pound ($9.7 billion) merger last year.</p>
<p>Excluding currency effects and a 167 million pound charge mainly relating to U.S. environmental provisioning pre-tax operating profits were 706 million pounds.</p>
</text>
